Language English
Debug Off

// All text in FirstRitual defaults to goal = closeGate

Book Mythos Ordered No Keep
	
	Page TakeAction 
		Not Visible
		Triggered By @Mythos
		No Text
		
		Trigger @Sarah
		Trigger @Wanderers
		Trigger @HealingStone
		Trigger @Ritual

		Exit
	End Page TakeAction

	// this will start and manage the ritual
	// the ritual runs to the end of the game for goalOpenGate
	// for goalFeedGate and goalCloseGate, it runs until the
	// investigators are pulled into the altar room
	Page StartOrContinueFirstRitual 
		Not Visible
		Triggered By @Ritual
		No Text
		
		If ritual Then Goto ContinueFirstRitual
		
		foundEverything = foundJournal And foundDvm And foundElderSign And foundRitualDagger
		exploredEverything = exploredCryptViaChapel And exploredDungeonCaveViaBasement And exploredDungeonCell
		didEverything = dvmFinished And journalFinished
		ready = foundEverything And exploredEverything And didEverything
		if ready Then Goto StartFirstRitual
		
		startRitualRound = foundSarahRound + (#heros = 3 ? 12 : #heros = 4 ? 10 : 8)
		If #round >= startRitualRound Goto StartFirstRitual
		
		Exit
	End Page StartOrContinueFirstRitual

	Page StartFirstRitual
		Not Visible
		ritual = 1
		
		Text """
			You stop in your tracks as something... happens to the house. You
			aren't sure what it is, but fear clutches your gut as the feeling
			washes over you.
			
			Each investigator takes 1 horror ({will} negates).
		"""
		
		Exit
	End Page StartFirstRitual
	
	Page ContinueFirstRitual
		Not Visible
		ritual = ritual + 1
		
		If ritual = 2 Then Goto FirstRitualKnife
		If ritual = 3 Then Goto FirstRitualChalice
		If ritual = 4 Then Goto FirstRitualWoman
		If ritual = 5 Then Goto FirstRitualOpen
		
		No Text
	End Page ContinueFirstRitual
	
	Page FirstRitualStart
		Not Visible
		
		Text """
			From deep in the house, you hear a boy scream in terror. It
			stops abruptly and you feel something change in the air. The floor
			shudders and everything goes quiet for a moment.

			Sarah's eyes widen and she whispers to {c:EventChosenInvestigator},
			<<Mathias has started. The ritual has started. We must get to the
			altar and stop him.>>			
			
		"""
		If goal == goalOpenGate Then Text """
			The hair on the back of your neck stands up as you feel a power
			filling the space around you. Something dark. Something evil.
			Something violent.
			
			Sarah's eyes widen and she whispers,
			<<Mathias begun preparations for the ritual, the preparations you
			read about in the {c:QItemDvm}. We must get to the altar before he
			actually opens the gate. We must stop him.>>
		"""
		
		Exit
	End Page FirstRitualStart
	
	Page FirstRitualKnife
		Not Visible
		
		Text """
			You feel something new within the power around you. Something that
			drains you, but somehow makes you feel stronger. You have a sudden
			flash of a knife being dragged across your palms.
			
			Sarah leans in and whispers, <<I can feel him preparing the dagger
			for the ritual. I can see on your face that you sense it too. We
			must find Mathias and stop him.
		"""
		
		Exit
	End Page FirstRitualKnife
	
	Page FirstRitualChalice
		Text """
			Another shock hits you, making you feel the knife in your palm
			again, then as if you were squeezing your hand into a tight fist.
			
			Sarah leans in and whispers, <<I can feel him putting his blood in
			a chalice. I can almost see it.>>
		"""
		
		Exit
	End Page FirstRitualChalice
	
	Page FirstRitualWoman
		Not Visible
		
		Text """
			You feel the first real power of the spell Mathias is casting as it
			intensifies what you feel around you. It draws you in and repulses
			you at the same time. A woman screams. The sound pierces the walls
			of the house, making the windows rattle in their frames. You feel
			her take a deep, ragged breath, then she screams again. And again.
			And again. Just as you start to feel like you might start screaming
			too, it abruptly stops, and you know she is dead.

			Each investigator takes 1 Horror ({will} negates).
		"""
		
		Exit
	End Page FirstRitualWoman
	
	Page FirstRitualOpen
		Not Visible
		
		Text """
			The woman's screaming abruptly stops and, for a moment, it is silent
			again, as if the house were taking a breath. A boy's single,
			terrified scream cuts through the silence. Though cannot see it,
			you feel the gate spring into being. You hear something moan in
			pain; you feel the rumblings of it through the house. You know in
			your gut that it's Mathias's son.

			The power of the gate has infused the air around you with a
			a nearly electric sense of evil, making your skin buzz
			in discomfort.
		"""
		
		Exit
	
	End Page FirstRitualOpen
	
	/*
	Ritual Steps in Mythos:
	
	Boy

	
		Rules:  every goal
	
	Gate
		You feel the power of the spell Mathias is casting. It draws you in and repulses you at the same time. A woman screams. The sound pierces the walls of the house, making the windows rattle in their frames. You feel her take a deep, gasping breath, then she screams again. And again. And again. The screaming sends a chill through you. Each investigator takes 2 Horror ({will} negates).
		
		if goalOpenGate: Sarah whispers, <<Our cousin has started the opening ritual. We must stop him.>>
		
		Rules:  every goal
		
		For goalOpenGate, this is the end; they have 2 - 3 rounds before a hard fail
		
	
	Woman

		
		If goalFeedGate, Sarah whispers, <<The gate is open, but you have the 
		elder sign. Mathias cannot stabilize the gate; instead, he will need a ready supply of blood sacrifice. Maybe
		we can cut off the supply.
		
		if goalCloseGate: Sarah whispers, <<The gate is open. You must perform the closing ritual.>>
		
		For goalFeedGate, this is the end. In 2 - 3 rounds, hard fail
		
		Rules:  goalFeedGate Or goalCloseGate
		
	Seal/Stabilize
			The woman screams again. After a few seconds, it doesn't sound human. Then the screaming stops and something... changes.
			The gates power in the house has been uneven, sputtering and popping, but now it is seems to be stabilizing. Sarah whispers,
			<<I think Mathias has used an elder sign to stabilize and hold open the gate. This is bad. We must get to the altar to stop him.>>
	
		Rules:  goalCloseGate

	Summons--at altar
		Mathias is still at the altar and still speaking a language you do not understand. The gate glows and hums, but it seems to be stable now. Mathias is focused on the gate. You can see by his excitement that he is anticipating something. You can feel it growing closer... a cold dread creeping into your already-pounding heart. You don't have long now. 

		Sarah confirms your fear when she leans in and says, <<He is summoning his god. You must stop him. You must kill him.>>

		Rules:  goalCloseGate And foundAltar

	Summons--not at altar
		You feel the house inhale again; your candle flickers and dances. A low drone signals that something important just happened. Even from here, away from the altar, you can feel a  pulsing of evil, a force from underground.

		Sarah whispers desperately, <<He has started the summoning. I can feel the call to his god. We don't have much time.>>

		Rules:  goalFeedGate Or goalCloseGate

	Summoning continues
		{c:CustomMonsterDavidSmythe} continues summoning... something.


	
	
	Continues
	Fail
	
	*/
	

End Book Mythos
